<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Form 2553</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        .header-title { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .form-header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .section-heading { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .field-row { display: flex; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 10pt; }
        .field-label { width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .field-value { flex-grow: 1; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px; }
        .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; font-size: 10pt; }
        .table-container { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
        .table-container th, .table-container td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px; text-align: left; font-size: 10pt; }
        .table-container th { background-color: #f0f0f0; }
        .signature-block { margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt; }
        .signature-line { border-top: 1px solid #000; width: 300px; margin-top: 50px; }
        .instruction-text { font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .page-number { position: absolute; bottom: 30px; right: 60px; font-size: 10pt; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Page 1 -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="form-header-info">
            <div>Form <span data-field="form_number">{{ form_number }}</span> (Rev. <span data-field="revision_date">{{ revision_date }}</span>)</div>
            <div>OMB No. 1545-0123</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div class="header-title">Election by a Small Business Corporation</div>
            <div class="instruction-text">
                (Under section 1362 of the Internal Revenue Code)
                <br>
                (Including a late election filed pursuant to Rev. Proc. 2013-30)
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <input type="checkbox"> You can fax this form to the IRS. See separate instructions.
            <br>
            Go to <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span> for instructions and the latest information.
        </div>

        <div class="instruction-text">
            Note: This election to be an S corporation can be accepted only if all the tests are met under Who May Elect in the instructions, all shareholders have signed the consent statement, an officer has signed below, and the exact name and address of the corporation (entity) and other required form information have been provided.
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Part I Election Information</div>
        <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field-label">Type or Print</div>
            <div class="field-value"><span data-field="entity_type">{{ entity_type }}</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field-label">Name (see instructions)</div>
            <div class="field-value"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="field-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">A Employer identification number</div>
            <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 3;"><span data-field="ein">{{ ein }}</span></div>
            <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">B Date incorporated</div>
            <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="incorporation_date">{{ incorporation_date }}</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">C State of incorporation</div>
            <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="state_of_incorporation">{{ state_of_incorporation }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">Election Checkboxes</div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">D Check the applicable box(es) if the corporation (entity), after applying for the EIN shown in A above, changed its <span data-field="name_or_address">{{ name_or_address }}</span> name or <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span> address</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> name</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox"> address</label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">E Election is to be effective for tax year beginning (month, day, year) (see instructions):</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> Calendar year</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox"> Fiscal year</label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="instruction-text" style="margin-top: 10px;">
            Caution: A corporation (entity) making the election for its first tax year in existence will usually enter the beginning date of a short tax year that begins on a date other than January 1.
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">Tax Year Election</div>
        <div class="field-row">
            <div style="width: 150px;">F Selected tax year:</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> Calendar year</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox"> Fiscal year</label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row">
            <div style="width: 150px;">G If more than 100 shareholders are listed for item J (see page 2), check this box if treating members of a family as one shareholder results in no more than 100 shareholders see instructions:</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">Shareholder Information</div>
        <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field-label">H Name and title of officer or legal representative whom the IRS may call for more information</div>
            <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 3;"><span data-field="officer_name_and_title">{{ officer_name_and_title }}</span></div>
            <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">Telephone number of officer or legal representative</div>
            <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="officer_phone">{{ officer_phone }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="instruction-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            I If this S corporation election is being filed late, I declare I have reasonable cause for not filing Form 2553 timely. If this late election is being made by an entity eligible to elect to be treated as a corporation, I declare I also had reasonable cause for not filing an entity classification election timely and the representations listed in Part IV are true. See below for my explanation of the reasons the election or elections were not made on time and a description of my diligent actions to correct the mistake upon its discovery. See instructions.
        </div>

        <div style="height: 150px; border: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 10px;"></div>

        <div class="signature-block">
            <div>
                <div class="signature-line"></div>
                <div style="margin-top: 5px;">Signature of officer</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="signature-line"></div>
                <div style="margin-top: 5px;">Title</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="signature-line"></div>
                <div style="margin-top: 5px;">Date</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="instruction-text" style="margin-top: 40px; font-size: 9pt;">
            For Paperwork Reduction Act Notice, see separate instructions.
        </div>
        <div class="form-header-info" style="justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 20px;">
            <div>Cat. No. 18629R</div>
            <div>Form <span data-field="form_number">{{ form_number }}</span> (Rev. <span data-field="revision_date">{{ revision_date }}</span>)</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Page 2 -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="form-header-info">
            <div>Form 2553 (Rev. 12-2017)</div>
            <div>Page 2</div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Part II Election Information (continued) Note: If you need more rows, use additional copies of page 2.</div>

        <div class="table-container">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 5%;">#</th>
                    <th style="width: 35%;">Shareholder's Consent Statement</th>
                    <th style="width: 20%;">Stock owned or percentage of ownership (see instructions)</th>
                    <th style="width: 20%;">Date(s)</th>
                    <th style="width: 20%;">Shareholder's Tax Year Ends (month and day)</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for i in range(10) %}
                <tr>
                    <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
                    <td>
                        <div style="height: 60px; border: 1px solid #000; padding: 5px;">
                            <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">Name and address of each shareholder or former shareholder required to consent to the election. (see instructions)</div>
                                <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].shareholder_name_address">{{ line_items[loop.index0].shareholder_name_address }}</span></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="field-row">
                                <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">Signature</div>
                                <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].signature">{{ line_items[loop.index0].signature }}</span></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <div style="height: 60px; border: 1px solid #000; padding: 5px;">
                            <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">Date of ownership</div>
                                <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].date_of_ownership">{{ line_items[loop.index0].date_of_ownership }}</span></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="field-row">
                                <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">Date acquired</div>
                                <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].date_acquired">{{ line_items[loop.index0].date_acquired }}</span></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <div style="height: 60px; border: 1px solid #000; padding: 5px;">
                            <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">Number of shares or percentage of ownership</div>
                                <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].ownership_percentage">{{ line_items[loop.index0].ownership_percentage }}</span></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="field-row">
                                <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">Date(s)</div>
                                <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].ownership_dates">{{ line_items[loop.index0].ownership_dates }}</span></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <div style="height: 60px; border: 1px solid #000; padding: 5px;">
                            <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">Shareholder's Tax Year Ends (month and day)</div>
                                <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].tax_year_end">{{ line_items[loop.index0].tax_year_end }}</span></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </div>

        <div class="page-number">Page 2</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Page 3 -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="form-header-info">
            <div>Form 2553 (Rev. 12-2017)</div>
            <div>Page 3</div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Part III Selection of Fiscal Tax Year (see instructions)</div>
        <div class="instruction-text">
            Check the applicable box to indicate whether the corporation is:
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">1. A new corporation adopting the tax year entered in Item F, Part I.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">2. An existing corporation changing to the tax year entered in Item F, Part I.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">3. An existing corporation changing to the tax year entered in Item F, Part I.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="instruction-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            If you check item 2 or 3, you must complete the applicable provisions of Rev. Proc. 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46.
        </div>
        <div class="instruction-text">
            If you check item 2 or 3, you must complete the applicable provisions of Rev. Proc. 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46, 2006-46.
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">Tax Year Election Checkboxes</div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">4. Check here if the fiscal year ended in Item F, Part I is requested under the prior approval provisions of Rev. Proc. 2006-46.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">5. Check here if the fiscal year ended in Item F, Part I is requested under the prior approval provisions of Rev. Proc. 2006-46.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">6. Check here if the fiscal year ended in Item F, Part I is requested under the prior approval provisions of Rev. Proc. 2006-46.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">Section 444 Election</div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">7. Note: If you do not use Item F and the corporation pays a fiscal tax year, complete either Item Q or R below. Item Q is used to request a fiscal tax year based on a business purpose and to make a back-up section 444 election. Item R is used to make a regular section 444 election.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">Q Business Purpose—To request a fiscal tax year based on a business purpose, check box Q1. See instructions for details regarding the business purpose. Attach to Form 2553.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">R Check here if the fiscal year entered in Item F, Part I is requested under the prior approval provisions of Rev. Proc. 2006-46.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">Check here if the corporation is making a back-up section 444 election in the event the corporation's business purpose request is not approved by the IRS. See instructions for more information.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">Check here if the corporation agrees to adopt or change to a tax year ending December 31 if necessary for the IRS to accept this election for S corporation status in the event the corporation's business purpose request is not approved and the corporation makes a back-up section 444 election.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">Section 444 Election—To make a section 444 election, check box R1. You may also check box R2.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">1. Check here if you show that the corporation agrees to adopt or change to a tax year ending December 31 if necessary for the IRS to accept this election for S corporation status in the event the corporation is ultimately not qualified to make a section 444 election.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="page-number">Page 3</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Page 4 -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="form-header-info">
            <div>Form 2553 (Rev. 12-2017)</div>
            <div>Page 4</div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Part IV Qualified Subchapter S Trust (QSST) Election Under Section 1361(d)(2) Note: If you are making more than one QSST election, use additional copies of page 4.</div>

        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div class="field-label">Income beneficiary's name and address</div>
            <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 3;"><span data-field="trustee_name_address">{{ trustee_name_address }}</span></div>
            <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">Social security number</div>
            <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="trustee_ssn">{{ trustee_ssn }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div class="field-label">Trust's name and address</div>
            <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 3;"><span data-field="trust_name_address">{{ trust_name_address }}</span></div>
            <div class="field-label" style="width: 150px;">Employer identification number</div>
            <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="trust_ein">{{ trust_ein }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">Trustee Information</div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div class="field-label">Date on which stock of the corporation was transferred to the trust (month, day, year)</div>
            <div class="field-value" style="flex-grow: 3;"><span data-field="transfer_date">{{ transfer_date }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="instruction-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            In order for the trust named above to be a QSST and thus a qualifying shareholder of the S corporation for which this Form 2553 is filed, I hereby make the election under section 1361(d)(2). Under penalties of perjury, I certify that the trust meets the definitional requirements of section 1361(d)(2) and that all other information provided in Part III is true, correct, and complete.
        </div>

        <div class="signature-block" style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <div>
                <div class="signature-line"></div>
                <div style="margin-top: 5px;">Signature of income beneficiary or signature and title of legal representative making the election</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="signature-line"></div>
                <div style="margin-top: 5px;">Date</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="instruction-text" style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 9pt;">
            *Use Part III to make the QSST election only if stock of the corporation has been transferred to the trust on or before the date on which the corporation makes its election to be an S corporation. The QSST election must be made and filed separately if stock of the corporation is transferred to the trust after the date on which the corporation makes the S election.
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">Part IV Late Corporation Classification Election Representations (see instructions)</div>
        <div class="instruction-text" style="margin-top: 10px;">
            If a late entity classification election was intended to be effective on the same date that the S corporation election was intended to be effective, relief for a late S corporation election must also include the following representations:
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">1 The requesting entity is an eligible entity as defined in Regulations section 301.7701-3(a);</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">2 The requesting entity intended to be classified as a corporation as of the effective date of the S corporation status;</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">3 The requesting entity fails to qualify as a corporation solely because Form 8832, Entity Classification Election, was not timely filed under Regulations section 301.7701-3(c)(1)(i); or Form 8832 was not deemed to have been filed under Regulations section 301.7701-3(c)(1)(i)(v);</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">4 The requesting entity fails to qualify as an S corporation on the effective date of the S corporation status solely because the S corporation election was not timely filed pursuant to section 1362(b); and</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">5a The requesting entity timely filed all required federal tax returns and information returns consistent with its requested classification as an S corporation for all years for which the election was intended to be effective, and no inconsistent tax or information returns have been filed by or with respect to the entity during any of the tax years, or</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 150px;">b The requesting entity has not filed a federal tax or information return for the first year in which the election was intended to be effective because the due date has not passed for that year's federal tax or information return.</div>
            <div class="checkbox-group" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <label><input type="checkbox"> </label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="page-number">Page 4</div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>